# 🧠 What Did We Learn?

| ✅ Good Practice                             | ❌ What Went Wrong                  |
| ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Never put secrets in HTML comments          | The flag was left inside a comment |
| Remove sensitive comments before deployment | Comments are visible in the source |
| Keep sensitive data server-side             | The secret was sent to the client  |
| Treat all client-side code as public        | Anyone could inspect the HTML      |

